<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We are lost amid the rapture of redeeming love:</l><l>Glory to God, hallelujah!</l><l>We are seeking every moment all its grace to prove:</l><l>Glory to God, hallelujah!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We are going on to glory as the Lord has told:</l><l>Glory to God, hallelujah!</l><l>Where the King in all His beauty we shall soon behold:</l><l>Glory to God, hallelujah!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>There we’ll sing His grace and mercy in a glad new song:</l><l>Glory to God, hallelujah!</l><l>There we’ll praise our glorious Savior with the blessed throng:</l><l>Glory to God, hallelujah!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
